# Legal three-cushion scoring shot: cue contacts yellow, then bottom/left/top cushions, then red.
# Goal: high-speed long-table scoring route with the red left undisturbed until final contact.
table three_cushion_carom_10ft
game three_cushion
ball cue at (2.119, 3.753)
ball yellow at (0.937, 2.689)
ball red at (1.210495808, 6.010194417)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
simulation(default)
  .preset(three_cushion)
  .max_events(24)
trace(max_events: 24)
shot(cue).heading(222.785767279deg).speed(175.860668856ips).tip(side: -0.089667499R, height: 0.323260328R).using(default)
